# Learn: lesson 1 (Gather supplies) finished by one gather (back to the
# lessons with its ✓), then lesson 3 (Build upward) built to its results by
# the keyboard as tools/plan.mjs t3 plays it, and Menu back to the title.
until 300 Blockstead
frames 150
click Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Learn
until 60 Gather supplies
frames 10
save learn
click Gather supplies
until 120 Goals
frames 30
expect Gather supplies — 0/1
save lesson1
key KeyG 2
until 60 ✓ Gather supplies
frames 10
save learn-done
click Build upward
until 120 Build upward — 0/1
frames 30
key Digit1 2
frames 6
key Enter 2
frames 6
key Digit1 2
frames 6
key Enter 2
frames 6
until 300 Settlement complete!
expect Total
frames 60
save lesson3-results
click Menu
until 120 Blockstead
expect Play
